 "text": "# Dropdowns\n\nType: Bootstrap drop-in. Write standard Bootstrap 5.3.8 markup. The kit only changes the look; no new classes are needed.\nSection: Componentes\nHuman version (rendered examples): componentes/dropdowns.html\nProse language: Brazilian Portuguese. Code, class names and identifier tables are language-neutral.\n\nMenus de contexto abertos por um botão. No kit usam o menu do jogo (lista com seleção azul).\n\n## Exemplo\n\n```\n<div class=\"dropdown\">\n  <button\n    class=\"btn btn-secondary dropdown-toggle\"\n    type=\"button\"\n    data-bs-toggle=\"dropdown\"\n    aria-expanded=\"false\">\n    Ações\n  </button>\n  <ul class=\"dropdown-menu\">\n    <li>\n      <h6 class=\"dropdown-header\">Personagem</h6>\n    </li>\n    <li><a class=\"dropdown-item active\" href=\"#\">Atacar</a></li>\n    <li><a class=\"dropdown-item\" href=\"#\">Falar</a></li>\n    <li>\n      <hr class=\"dropdown-divider\">\n    </li>\n    <li><a class=\"dropdown-item disabled\" href=\"#\" aria-disabled=\"true\">Ignorar</a></li>\n  </ul>\n</div>\n```\n\n## Direções e tamanhos\n\n```\n<div class=\"btn-group\">\n  <button\n    class=\"btn btn-primary dropdown-toggle\"\n    data-bs-toggle=\"dropdown\"\n    aria-expanded=\"false\">\n    Abaixo\n  </button>\n  <ul class=\"dropdown-menu\">\n    <li><a class=\"dropdown-item\" href=\"#\">Item</a></li>\n  </ul>\n</div>\n<div class=\"btn-group dropend\">\n  <button\n    class=\"btn btn-primary dropdown-toggle\"\n    data-bs-toggle=\"dropdown\"\n    aria-expanded=\"false\">\n    Direita\n  </button>\n  <ul class=\"dropdown-menu\">\n    <li><a class=\"dropdown-item\" href=\"#\">Item</a></li>\n  </ul>\n</div>\n<div class=\"btn-group dropup\">\n  <button\n    class=\"btn btn-primary dropdown-toggle\"\n    data-bs-toggle=\"dropdown\"\n    aria-expanded=\"false\">\n    Acima\n  </button>\n  <ul class=\"dropdown-menu\">\n    <li><a class=\"dropdown-item\" href=\"#\">Item</a></li>\n  </ul>\n</div>\n<div class=\"btn-group\">\n  <button\n    class=\"btn btn-sm btn-secondary dropdown-toggle\"\n    data-bs-toggle=\"dropdown\"\n    aria-expanded=\"false\">\n    Pequeno\n  </button>\n  <ul class=\"dropdown-menu dropdown-menu-end\">\n    <li><a class=\"dropdown-item\" href=\"#\">Alinhado à direita</a></li>\n  </ul>\n</div>\n```\n\nDerived/invented (not in the original game)\n\nO cabeçalho do dropdown (dropdown-header) é derivado; o jogo não tem menu com títulos.\n\n## Menu de contexto por JavaScript\n\nSem Bootstrap, CRO.menu(itens, x, y) abre o mesmo visual em qualquer ponto. Veja Diálogos.\n\n## Todas as variações\n\n```\n<div class=\"btn-group\">\n  <button class=\"btn btn-secondary\">Dividido</button>\n  <button\n    class=\"btn btn-secondary dropdown-toggle dropdown-toggle-split\"\n    data-bs-toggle=\"dropdown\"\n    aria-expanded=\"false\">\n    <span class=\"visually-hidden\">Alternar</span>\n  </button>\n  <ul class=\"dropdown-menu\">\n    <li><a class=\"dropdown-item\" href=\"#\">Ação</a></li>\n  </ul>\n</div>\n<div class=\"btn-group dropstart\">\n  <button\n    class=\"btn btn-secondary dropdown-toggle\"\n    data-bs-toggle=\"dropdown\"\n    aria-expanded=\"false\">\n    dropstart\n  </button>\n  <ul class=\"dropdown-menu\">\n    <li><a class=\"dropdown-item\" href=\"#\">Ação</a></li>\n  </ul>\n</div>\n<div class=\"btn-group\">\n  <button\n    class=\"btn btn-secondary dropdown-toggle\"\n    data-bs-toggle=\"dropdown\"\n    aria-expanded=\"false\">\n    menu-start\n  </button>\n  <ul class=\"dropdown-menu dropdown-menu-start\">\n    <li><a class=\"dropdown-item\" href=\"#\">Ação</a></li>\n    <li><span class=\"dropdown-item-text\">dropdown-item-text</span></li>\n  </ul>\n</div>\n<div class=\"btn-group\">\n  <button\n    class=\"btn btn-secondary dropdown-toggle\"\n    data-bs-toggle=\"dropdown\"\n    aria-expanded=\"false\">\n    menu-dark\n  </button>\n  <ul class=\"dropdown-menu dropdown-menu-dark\">\n    <li><a class=\"dropdown-item\" href=\"#\">Ação</a></li>\n  </ul>\n</div>\n```\n\nClasses: dropstart, dropend, dropup, dropdown-center, dropup-center, dropdown-menu-start/end, dropdown-toggle-split, dropdown-item-text, dropdown-menu-dark.\n\nLimitation\n\ndropdown-menu-dark não escurece o menu: o menu do jogo é sempre claro e o kit vence o Bootstrap. É coerente com a decisão de não ter modo escuro.\n« Collapse · List group »\n",
